    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Last night wasn't the first time Michael's come looking for you, was it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "You haven't been in Wrankwood for long, and you're certainly not the type who would have meddled with something so far outside the scope your duties, if he hadn't been pestering you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "He came to me the day after Dalton died and I took over the prop team.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "He wanted to leave without going through the normal process, and without anyone noticing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Without, like, telling Miss Stone or going through the contract cancellation and exit procedures?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But he's the lead actor. Someone was bound to find out, and he'd have to pay the contract penalty anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unless... something here scared him more than paying the penalty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "He said since the prop team had access to all the tools and was familiar with the structure of the plate, he wondered if I could...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you could think of a way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, I'm sure you could, but Michael's not done with his scenes yet. If he really got away and Miss Stone found out you helped him... she wouldn't let you off the hook easy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "She could even end your career in Wrankwood!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What would your sister think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "My sister...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you say the rest of your family was against you coming to Wrankwood, and she's the only one who cheered you on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "You <i>have</i> to make it, and not just to prove your family wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just don't want to disappoint my sister. I want her to be happy for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "S-So don't be mad, Tippi...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just mad that you were hiding stuff from me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you'd never agree to Michael's demands. You just didn't know how to refuse him... I can help with that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, Tippi. I've never seen you so angry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sh-Should we watch a movie together?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
