    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "62_g12_dressingroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You want to sneak off the plate with me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, babe. After we spend some <i>quality time</i> here, we can go and pack up right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if that prop girl really does find a way for you to circumvent the exit procedures... how do you expect to avoid the penalty for breaching your contract?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shooting isn't over yet, and you know Greta. She'll make you pay an arm and a leg!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who cares about some stupid contract when there's a killer on the loose?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dalton's dead, Shelly's dead... how long do you think it'll be before you and I are next?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We both watched and did nothing when Laura died five years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether the killer is her lover, her dad, or some self-righteous vigilante, he's clearly after everyone who was involved!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "He wants us to repent and pay for what we did!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can take you away from this awful place, babe. We have our whole future ahead of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha, how romantic of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "But since when has your love been so deep?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So even when you were winking at Melanie, and flirting with Anna from stage design and Mila from logistics...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're telling me you were seriously thinking about spending the rest of your life with me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "D-Does that matter right now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course it does\u2014I'm not going, Michael.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "And neither are you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know how hard it was to get you a lead role in one of Greta's films? And not just one, but three at once!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Play this right, and you'll be a bona fide Wrankwood movie star!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There'll be another chance...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at me, Michael.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your costume in <i>The Death of Lady Dupont</i> is even more exquisite and eye-catching than Melanie's, the title character.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your perfume, what you wore to fashion week\u2014I bought all of that with my own money. Even those fake ears and tail that let you pass as a Vulpo came from me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Without me, the public will find out that this 'Michael' product suddenly doesn't seem so shiny anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've been together for five years. I gave up everything for you. I've spent so much of my savings, and I'm not getting any younger... I can't afford to wait for 'another chance'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "I love you, Michael. So don't let me down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "You... love me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were glad when Melanie publicly revealed our relationship the day Dalton died, weren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "To everyone else, I'm the troublemaking playboy, while you're the poor, suffering girlfriend who gave everything only to get nothing in return but mockery.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "How very sympathetic, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what part of that is a lie?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You said it yourself: you're just investing in a product. <i>Investment costs money.</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd have invested in Dalton instead, wouldn't you, if he hadn't become a hopeless drunk?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just a parasite looking for a host, Marion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is stupid... And I'm stupid too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I guess that's it for us. You can stay if you want\u2014I'm outta here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, and here's a tip: if you're looking for your next investment, try that pretty boy Lucian. He caught the entire crew's attention his first time in front of a camera. He's the real deal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The moment you walk out of here, I'm reporting you to Greta.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You cold-hearted lunatic. Are you not afraid of the killer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And why should I be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Five years ago, I didn't even know why Laura fell to her death until later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>You're</i> the one who watched and did nothing, not me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you looking at, Michael?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Rage overcomes the 'Vulpo' like a tidal wave. He sees a fire axe in a corner of the makeup room and clenches his fists."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
