        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi & Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$normal_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would they go down into the power deck?! Sure, there were mannequins all over the surface, but there had to have been a better plan, right Molly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I agree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's nowhere to run from the Wraith in the tight spaces of a nomadic city's underground structure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, it found them one by one and hung them from the ducts to await a slow death in the endless darkness...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I went to one of the cast's interviews, and they said it was inspired by the rituals of certain Columbian wasteland tribes. Something about atonement and judgment...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, how they got there was kinda dumb, but I did like the segment in the power deck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because it was all shot on location!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rumor has it that they ran out of cash, so they snuck into another film's studio plate and finished the shooting there... Exciting, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait... but I've seen this movie in theaters. Why don't I remember any of these scenes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because we're watching a copy of the original reel that was sent to the ratings agencies!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How did you even get your hands on something like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's, like, a basic skill for a true horror fan!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're hiding something, Tippi...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know so much about the industry and all the ins-and-outs of Wrankwood. How does a background painter get so much insider knowledge?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "How can you do this to me, Molly?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I share my super-secret treasure with you, hoping to make you happy, and all I get is an interrogation? *Sob*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aw, don't cry, I won't ask anymore, alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's just focus on the movie... so stop looking away from the screen!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, you noticed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, there's just been so much going on with the film crew lately, I'm... I'm a little nervous...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, I'm here for you, girl!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You sure are!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Feeling better now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "62_i12",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1,
        "yScaleFrom": 1,
        "xScaleTo": 1.4,
        "yScaleTo": 1.4,
        "duration": 60
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, listen up, Molly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter who I am, one thing's for sure: I'm your best friend on this crew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "So if there's a killer on the loose, I'll protect you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if work's not going well, we can do it together. We'll make our names as Wrankwood's golden horror duo, Tippi the spray-painter and Moira the prop-maker!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "And when we're <i>really</i> close, I'll take you to meet my family... Although I don't know if you'll be scared or surprised!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I'll introduce you to my sister too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll share stories of Wrankwood while she peels us apples. She can peel one without breaking the skin in under half a minute! I know you'll love her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now there's an offer I can't refuse!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "The old TV lights up both the darkened room and their faces. Terrifying sounds echo throughout, but take nothing away from their smiles."
    },
    {
        "text": "They cuddle up against one another, fighting their fear with a much more familiar 'fear', and dreaming of the future of their budding friendship."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is a rare, quiet evening."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
