    },
    {
        "text": "Why is the set so dark?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh* I should've asked Moira. She's always here early, and she knows where all the switches are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The prop room isn't that far, is it? Have I been going around in circles? ...Something doesn't seem right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$blooddrop",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Am I hearing things?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$blooddrop"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The sound of water dripping echoes through the empty set as though answering Hautin's question, but such 'response' serves only to increase her confusion and fear."
    },
    {
        "text": "She knows there are no water pipes above her, but the sound she is hearing is definitely coming from nearby."
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this another one of those stupid pranks you'll laugh at me over drinks after work for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "text": "C-Come out now and I won't hold it against you! Or don't tell me Moira's in on it too? She's just a kid, how could you make her\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "0,-80",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 15,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ouch\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
