    },
    {
        "text": "Hautin falls backwards to the ground. Only then does she realize that she is wearing a flashlight on her belt. But she barely has time to laugh at herself before she smells a strong, sweet scent accompanied by a tang of iron."
    },
    {
        "text": "Frightened, she stands up and turns on her flashlight\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_doorknob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$m_avg_creepy_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "cgitem",
        "image": "cgitem_62_i03",
        "style": "cg",
        "pfrom": "0,-30",
        "pto": "0,0",
        "pduration": 10,
        "layer": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "aduration": 3,
        "sfrom": 1.5,
        "sto": 1,
        "sduration": 60
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A breeze sways the ropes. Hanging down from them are two familiar and strangely quiet figures."
    },
    {
        "text": "The two lovers, Michael and Marion, subject of much of the crew's gossip, have met their deaths with their backs against each other."
    },
    {
        "text": "Through the faint light, Hautin sees their faces, their expressions, the way they sway through the air, and the dancing specks of dust..."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is indescribably eerie, and somehow... sacred."
    },
    {
        "text": "She remembers what Tippi said when she joined one of her movie sessions..."
    },
    {
        "text": "In the rituals of certain Columbian wasteland tribes, hanging represents both judgment of the dead, and a warning for the living."
    },
    {
        "text": "Until the scorching sun cracks their corpses open, until all believe they deserved their punishment, until the ropes can no longer bear the weight of their sin\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown2",
        "channel": "a",
        "delay": 0.1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thump."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "H-Help! Somebody! Anybody!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The unlucky stagehand runs outside. As she does, a thought flashes through her mind\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "What an absurd morning."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
